"value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"68"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sophomore at the private W University Humanities Department in Tokyo. He attends the Minzoku (Folklore) Seminar. He's a very ordinary young man, neither particularly unique now nor in the past. Though he desires a girlfriend, he lacks the courage to properly confess to the person he likes, so he finds it difficult to do so. He's close friends with Yasuchika and often hangs out with him. However, his role mainly involves accurately retorting to Yasuchika's jokes, so people around them think of them as a comedy duo or see him as the one who cleans up after the troubles caused by Yasuchika."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of his pleasant demeanor, he may seem somewhat timid and unreliable, but he's the type of person who displays initiative and judgment precisely when needed, becoming dependable in critical moments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"TL from DLsite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c102267"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。都内にある、私立W大学人文学部に通う大学2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"民俗学の源ゼミ（みなもとゼミ）に席を置いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今も昔も特に珍しくはない、ごく普通の若者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛などに対しても、彼女が欲しいとは思うものの、意中の相手にきちんと告白する…といったことは勇気が持てずになかなか言い出せない優柔不断な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中学、高校時代などには女性と交際したこともあるが、関係としてはいいところキスどまりなので、いまだ童貞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰親とは親友と言っていい間柄で、大学を離れてもいつもつるんで遊んでいるが、主に泰親のボケに対して、的確にツッコむという役どころなので、周囲からは漫才のようなコンビ、あるいは泰親の巻き起こしたトラブルの尻ぬぐいをする役まわりだと思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腕っ節はそれほど強くはないが、機転が利くタイプ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9272","sourceWorkId":"16306","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：174cm　 体重：68kg　 血液型：O型"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。都内にある私立W大学人文学部に通う大学2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"民俗学の源ゼミに席を置いている。 今も昔も特に珍しくはない、ごく普通の若者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が欲しいとは思うものの、意中の相手にきちんと告白するといったことは、勇気が持てずになかなか出来ないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰親とは親友と言っていい間柄で、いつもつるんで遊んでいるが、主に泰親のボケに対して的確にツッコむという役まわりなので、周囲からは漫才のようなコンビ、もしくは泰親の巻き起こしたトラブルの尻ぬぐいをさせられる役まわりだと思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりが良いせいか、なんとなく気が弱そうで頼りなさそうに見えるが、ここぞという時に行動力と判断力を発揮する “いざという時に頼りになる” タイプの人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「安易に霊的なものと決めつけたくないけど……俺たちの周囲で“なにか不気味なこと”が起きてるのは間違いない……と思うんだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"95324"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"20 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9272","sourceWorkId":"16306","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"174 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9272","sourceWorkId":"16306","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"68 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9272","sourceWorkId":"16306","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/5304a090ac1faf64f163bf96b0f2aeb37cf7cfeb3cb7b28fb822a70d36f235e1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dffd35e104fcadc77b287e4d1631ab2d1867a2cbe241ad4dbbff5e9a6c195bdc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c59585","characterName":"中宮 聖子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"95317","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116852"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9265"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59585"},"originalCharacterName":"中宮 聖子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"sour